.TH tuwc n 0.23.0 tclutils "Tcl Library Procedures"
.SH NAME
tuwc \-  tclutils::tuwc  counts lines, words, characters and bytes.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
.nf
package require tclutils::tuwc
.fi
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
.nf
::tclutils::tuwc::text data
::tclutils::tuwc::file filename
.fi
.SH RESULT
.PP
Both commands return a dictionary:
.PP
.nf
lines 10 words 42 chars 180 bytes 190
.fi
.PP
The \fBfile\fR command additionally adds the key \fBfile\fR.

